      "worked_solution": "To find the two consecutive tenths between which ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/4be23abb7ad197619ea40d11d47cf1fdbb147bfdb686ebb3ec3edf35fe86a11a.svg) lies, we need to find two numbers with one decimal place whose cubes bracket ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/c470a153cbef9a736d6098e83a3cfe29bd8aab79763d40e7d037249050243a38.svg).\n\nFirst, let's establish between which two consecutive integers ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/4be23abb7ad197619ea40d11d47cf1fdbb147bfdb686ebb3ec3edf35fe86a11a.svg) lies.\nWe know that ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/0a53cb6ef00f2cee34191c318c35c03772be8c31188a3d08a3934c0bd7bcecc1.svg) and ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/99407afccad5e3e8923e1f7baefd9c2c39a0527a7891c4fbeed2f278831675b3.svg).\nSince ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/5283496580d408c3985a17e58b695eff54043bfcaaee8f2289f795ee2bb3383e.svg), we know that ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/88c76039d22e912b07971b62a9f1625d144396596eb04a37713b2b8d5145a9a8.svg).\n\nNext, we can test decimals between ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/402ff5d0c0c3aaa47f18c89f6d96c95d47840eac13822d596a51bdb0c5f9a4ab.svg) and ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/0cf2eee0cdec31b7acdc244a255aaee7d6d520cfeee67b64ac9cf215f5377477.svg) to narrow down the interval:\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/732e30063191974603e50ade6b2d95bbe7064d4a29d1a03f607f73b65545e3e4.svg)\n\nSince ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/7ed21dc216d8118e893b07314d80a792d90411459ee9ea6f57de2ddbdb9a2f60.svg), we can write:\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/79e2114a0d701bc50c5b8296a1379cc1e86348678c137f32b59b16f3ad40530a.svg)\n\nTaking the cube root of each part of the inequality gives:\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/c6f904b992c68db63b37b809d99a8f385c55c1218d7eae5dbcf430698010e4e0.svg)\n\nTherefore, ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/4be23abb7ad197619ea40d11d47cf1fdbb147bfdb686ebb3ec3edf35fe86a11a.svg) lies between ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/a5d561e3e5649657cfd9407bba6b91bee82f1a2c0d2d745e9c168b2cdf060ed6.svg) and ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14185481/assets/96fb4a6bbc8edb4f40fafdecd98c0c3a20d38e9449a3cba5170ff6b1f7371537.svg).",
